/-!
# Extensions: four results on the critical 2D KPZ process

The extension library proves strict skewness, response to the initial condition,
Brownian motion across scales and the finite-dimensional Gaussian free field
tangent (Theorems A–D of Scott Armstrong's note, *Four results on the critical
2D KPZ process*). This root imports all extension modules.
-/
